VENDORED CODE (committed in this repository)
--------------------------------------------
firmware/src/hal/display/LCD_3in49.c
firmware/src/hal/display/LCD_3in49.h
firmware/src/hal/display/DEV_Config.h
firmware/src/hal/display/dev_config.c
  Waveshare Team, MIT licensed, adapted for this project.

  Note: Waveshare's Touch.c was deliberately NOT used. Its I2C calls have no
  timeout, so a touch controller that fails to ACK locks up the whole device.
  firmware/src/hal/touch.c reimplements the same protocol with timeouts.

